export async function syncMeetupMembers(opts: { members?: boolean; rsvps?: boolean; maxEvents?: number } = {}): Promise<{ members?: number; linked?: number; rsvpEvents?: number; rsvps?: number; rsvpFailed?: number; remaining?: number }> {
  const { data, error } = await supabase.functions.invoke('meetup-sync-members', { body: opts });
  if (error) {
    let msg = 'Sync from Meetup failed.';
    if (error instanceof FunctionsHttpError) { try { const j = await error.context.json(); msg = j.message ?? j.error ?? msg; } catch {} }
    throw new Error(msg);
  }
  return data;
}

// ---- Site analytics (edge function ga-stats; server checks app_moderators / dashboard_admins)
export type GaStats = {
  site: string; days: number; generatedAt: string;
  series: { date: string; users: number; sessions: number; views: number }[];
  sources: { name: string; sessions: number }[];
  pages: { path: string; views: number; users: number }[];
  countries: { name: string; users: number }[];
  keyEvents: Record<string, Record<string, number>>;
  /** Only when site === 'app': chat-app counts from Supabase for the same range. */
  product?: { newProfiles: number; totalProfiles: number; messages: number; rooms: number; meetupLinked: number };
};
export async function getGaStats(site: string, days: number): Promise<GaStats> {
  const { data, error } = await supabase.functions.invoke('ga-stats', { body: { site, days } });
  if (error) {
    let msg = error.message;
    try { const b = await (error as any).context?.json?.(); if (b?.error) msg = b.error; } catch {}
    throw new Error(msg);
  }
  if ((data as any)?.error) throw new Error((data as any).error);
  return data as GaStats;
}
